# The stage-G imitation dataset. Regenerateable from a fixed seed range, and
# `plan3.md` asks for `data/` as a whole to be ignored - which also ignores
# `data/manifest.json`. Its contents are reproduced in `reports/g_report.md`.
data/

# Runtime-generated game data (recreated on first play)
records.json
settings.json

